# Everything here is per-checkout except the CA the client verifies against and
# the script that mints a key pair.
#
# The private key, the signed certificate and the CSR were tracked until
# 2026-09-14 despite these rules, because gitignore does not apply to files
# that are already committed. They still exist in history - see the root README.
*
!.gitignore
!cacsertificate.crt
!generate_keys.sh
